# No commit co-authors

When creating or amending git commits in this repository:

- Do **not** add any `Co-authored-by:` trailer
- Do **not** attribute commits to Cursor, cursoragent, or any AI identity
- Commit author and committer must remain the human git user only (`FinSage-max` / configured `user.name` + `user.email`)
- If a commit message template or hook injects `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, strip it before finishing the commit (rewrite with `git commit-tree` / amend with `--no-verify` if needed)

Example of what must never appear in a commit message:

```text
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```
